,"kind":"update","title":"Kitaria Fables 2 demo patch 0.9.0.9d3 now live","summary":"Please see below for the Kitaria Fables 2 demo patch 0.9.0.9d3 changelog:Camera improvementsImproved camera collision detection resulting in a much smoother experienceVisualsUpdated the interiors of homestead, tavern, errand house, bakery, and potion shop to make them feel more cozyFixed an issue where Fletcher was missing a character portraitPQube, Secret Level Studios, and Twin Hearts","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:47:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036070","verified_at":"2026-10-23T17:25:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3471750-1846651706695884","game_id":"steam-3471750","kind":"update","title":"Kitaria Fables 2 demo patch 0.9.0.9d2 now live","summary":"Please see below for the Kitaria Fables 2 demo patch 0.9.0.9d2 changelog:Camera improvementsAdded mouse sensitivity controlsAdded gamepad sensitivity controlsAdded camera invert settingsPQube, Secret Level Studios, and Twin Hearts","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T16:07:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695884","verified_at":"2026-10-21T02:07:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3471750-1846651706691718","game_id":"steam-3471750","kind":"announcement","title":"Kitaria Fables 2 is in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Greetings Adventurers!Kitaria Fables 2 is officially part of Steam Next Fest October 2026! 🥳So if you haven’t tried the brand-new Kitaria Fables 2 demo yet, now is the perfect time!Here’s a reminder of what to expect from this special demo version with over 4 hours of content including:· A prologue tutorial and main story mission to follow.· 22 side quests and 11 job quests to discover.· 20 enemies to battle, including tough mini-bosses!· 4 x active skills, 4 x passive skills, and 1 x character ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:19:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691718","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3471750-1846651706682352","game_id":"steam-3471750","kind":"announcement","title":"New 'Overview Trailer' revealed!","summary":"Hey everybody!We hope you’ve been enjoying the Kitaria Fables 2 demo that released a few days back? We’d love to hear your thoughts so if you’ve got time please consider leaving a review, as constructive feedback and recommendations are very much appreciated at this stage. 🙏Check out the demo here ➡️ Today we’ve got more positive news to share as Kitaria Fables 2 is part of the official selection for The MIX Fall Showcase 2026. To coincide with this fantastic event, we’ve released a new ‘Overvie","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T16:59:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682352","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3471750-1846651706682165","game_id":"steam-3471750","kind":"update","title":"Kitaria Fables 2 demo patch 0.9.0.9 now live","summary":"Please see below for the Kitaria Fables 2 demo patch 0.9.0.9 changelog:Balance changesAdjusted Dusty’s first skill to be slightly weaker but with a shorter cooldownClay resources are more plentifulAdded an extra skill point to the chest in the coastal lowlands castleDrop rate for upgrade stone resources has been improvedVisual improvementsDig spots are easier to seeMoved logs from the picnic area on Kiki’s farmBug fixesAlice’s skills can no longer target inanimate objectsFixed ‘Training Daggers’","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T16:10:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682165","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3471750-1846651706674247","game_id":"steam-3471750","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the Kitaria Fables 2 demo now!","summary":"The time has come adventurers!Join Alice and Dusty as they take their very first steps into the wilds of the Arkadera Peninsula in the Kitaria Fables 2 demo, available to play now!What’s included in the demo?Arriving at the peaceful haven of Whitewall Town, freshly graduated Royal Army Pathfinder Alice and plucky local guide Dusty join up with administrator Fawn and begin their mission to assist the townspeople while charting the wild lands to the north.Explore the bustling streets of the port b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T13:07:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674247","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3471750-1842846814455932","game_id":"steam-3471750","kind":"announcement","title":"Learn more about the new quest system!","summary":"Welcome back adventurers! In our last post we gave you a complete introduction to the Arkadera Peninsula including a closer look at the very first zone you’ll be exploring, the breezy Coastal Lowlands! In today’s post we’re turning our attention to the new quest system, learning about Whitewall Town’s fabled Errand House, and revealing the different kinds of tasks that you’ll be completing throughout your adventure.Welcome to the Errand House!Following their arrival in Whitewall Town, Alice and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T15:00:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455932","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3471750-1840310314342018","game_id":"steam-3471750","kind":"announcement","title":"Introducing the world of Kitaria Fables 2!","summary":"Greetings, budding adventurers! Since our last update back in May we’ve been hard at work behind the scenes creating all sorts of fabulous new content, and today we’ve got plenty of news to share 🥳 First up, we’re pleased to reveal that Kitaria Fables 2 will launch in Spring 2027. Now that might seem a little way off, but have no fear, you’ll be able to get hands-on with a special beta version sooner than you think! In the next few weeks we’ll be revealing more information about the dates of a c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T14:01:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342018","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3471750-1832065502815632","game_id":"steam-3471750","kind":"announcement","title":"Get to know the residents of Whitewall Town!","summary":"Hey everyone! How are you all doing? It’s been a few weeks since we announced Kitaria Fables 2 and we’re sure you’re excited to learn more about what the sequel has in store! Well good news! Over the coming weeks we’ll be posting frequent updates where we’ll be revealing more about the expanded world of Kitaria, taking a closer look at new gameplay mechanics, as well as sharing development updates and insights. So let’s get started! In today’s post we’ll be revealing more about the Royal Academy","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-08T16:00:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502815632","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3471750-1830163047258527","game_id":"steam-3471750","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing Kitaria Fables 2!","summary":"Hey everybody! It’s been a long time coming but we can finally reveal Kitaria Fables 2, the next instalment in the beloved action-RPG series set in the magical world of Kitaria! Following the events of 2021’s Kitaria Fables, this direct sequel introduces two brand-new heroes, Alice Skylar and Dusty Tuftkin, as they join up with the Royal Academy Expedition Team on a mission to the remote Arkadera Peninsula. Check out the announcement trailer as revealed during today's Galaxies Spring Showcase an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-16T20:32:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047258527","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3471750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:16Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3471750":"2026-10-26T10:38:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3471750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:16Z"},"4665050":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:16Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3471750","app_id":3471750,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:18Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","cont